{"id":"759d12ef70a1bbd4","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FmIRow.md","title":"FmIRow","display":"FmIRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"FmIRow","parameters":["z82","z83","z84"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"FmIRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>z82</span><span>z83</span><span>z84</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：命题语法。有序参数：<code>z82</code>、<code>z83</code>、<code>z84</code>。</p>\n<p>有限带标签公式。：单行局部条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ FmIRow z82 z83 z84)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists t\n  (and\n    (= z84 t)\n    (or\n      (exists z87 (and (@ Nat z87) (@ PAtom z87 t)))\n      (or\n        (exists z88\n          (exists z89\n            (and\n              (@ PImp z88 z89 t)\n              (and\n                (exists z90 (exists z91 (and (in z90 z83) (and (@ App z82 z90 z91) (= z91 z88)))))\n                (exists z92 (exists z93 (and (in z92 z83) (and (@ App z82 z92 z93) (= z93 z89)))))))))\n        (or\n          (@ PBot t)\n          (or\n            (exists z94\n              (exists z95\n                (and\n                  (@ PAnd z94 z95 t)\n                  (and\n                    (exists z96 (exists z97 (and (in z96 z83) (and (@ App z82 z96 z97) (= z97 z94)))))\n                    (exists z98 (exists z99 (and (in z98 z83) (and (@ App z82 z98 z99) (= z99 z95)))))))))\n            (exists z100\n              (exists z101\n                (and\n                  (@ POr z100 z101 t)\n                  (and\n                    (exists z102 (exists z103 (and (in z102 z83) (and (@ App z82 z102 z103) (= z103 z100)))))\n                    (exists z104 (exists z105 (and (in z104 z83) (and (@ App z82 z104 z105) (= z105 z101)))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e2136a636857d477\" href=\"?note=e2136a636857d477\" title=\"ZFC_Nat\">Nat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"635d3a0d1ddc63d5\" href=\"?note=635d3a0d1ddc63d5\" title=\"ZFC_PAnd\">PAnd</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"30627acf823af3c5\" href=\"?note=30627acf823af3c5\" title=\"ZFC_PAtom\">PAtom</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"8839a547e393d0af\" href=\"?note=8839a547e393d0af\" title=\"ZFC_PBot\">PBot</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"88931f785a07870f\" href=\"?note=88931f785a07870f\" title=\"ZFC_PImp\">PImp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"892530c42a605aab\" href=\"?note=892530c42a605aab\" title=\"ZFC_POr\">POr</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ FmIRow z82 z83 z84)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_App|App]]；[[ZFC_Nat|Nat]]